git-khronos (0.1.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add a reviewed WSL shortcut check and explicit confirmed taskbar repair.
  * Improve dialog layout and selection of root files after a blocked discard.
  * Preserve nested-path discard refusal and discarded-change recovery.
  * Gate Ubuntu 22.04, 24.04 and 26.04 releases on one Jammy-built package.
  * Retain separately supplied Git >=2.39 as an Ubuntu 22.04 prerequisite.

